Package: numericals7
Title: Numerical Kernels for Statistical Modeling
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R:
    person("Giovanni", "Tinervia", , "giovannitinervia9@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The numerical layer of a statistical modeling toolkit, written
    once and consumed by the packages above it. Jets carry a value together
    with every partial derivative to fourth order, propagate exactly through
    sums, products and a vocabulary of smooth functions, and dispatch on the
    ordinary arithmetic operators, so a map written in plain R differentiates
    itself. The combinatorial enumerations a higher-order chain rule rests on
    -- index tuples, set partitions, weak compositions -- live beside them,
    in one copy.
